WEBVTT

00:24.670 --> 00:25.980
That twerp!

00:25.980 --> 00:28.170
He also stuffed his
stomach while he was at it.

00:29.420 --> 00:31.320
I'm starving!

00:30.920 --> 00:31.090
160?

00:33.310 --> 00:35.220
<i>Kreper, can you read me?</i>

00:35.220 --> 00:37.470
Come in, Kreper!

00:37.950 --> 00:40.140
This is the Kreper, identify yourself.

00:40.140 --> 00:41.730
<i>Iria, it’s you!</i>

00:41.730 --> 00:43.330
<i>You’re still alive!</i>

00:43.330 --> 00:45.350
<i>You recognise my voice, right?</i>

00:46.690 --> 00:49.680
Didn't want to hear it,
and I wish I could forget it.

00:50.460 --> 00:53.940
<i>Come to gate eight, I’ll be waiting.</i>

00:53.940 --> 00:55.780
Yeah, you'll be
waiting until you're dead.

00:55.780 --> 00:57.780
<i>Hey, hold it, I was...</i>

00:59.130 --> 01:01.520
I didn't need to hear that.

01:23.660 --> 01:26.150
I'll take a shower when I get home.

01:47.580 --> 01:54.640
<i>The night sky has betrayed the stars...</i>

01:58.090 --> 02:05.290
<i>A faraway cry slowly fades.</i>

02:08.520 --> 02:18.950
<i>The sun has disappeared...</i>

02:18.950 --> 02:28.540
<i>and my heart is alone
with the revelation.</i>

02:32.170 --> 02:39.860
<i>A stranger's dreams appear.</i>

02:42.640 --> 02:50.600
<i>Tempting lost souls.</i>

02:53.060 --> 03:00.710
<i>A stranger's dreams appear.</i>

02:59.070 --> 03:02.970
Iria: Zeiram the Animation

03:02.970 --> 03:06.660
Vestige

03:45.600 --> 03:48.290
<i>Ghomvak Security and Investigations.</i>

03:48.590 --> 03:51.280
I'm Iria, Hunter Glen's assistant.

03:51.280 --> 03:52.500
How is Bob doing?

03:52.920 --> 03:55.320
<i>— You’re calling about Bob?</i>
— Yes, Bob.

03:55.320 --> 03:57.460
<i>I’m afraid he’s no longer with us.</i>

03:58.350 --> 04:00.490
<i>He passed away three days
ago, in a traffic accident.</i>

04:00.490 --> 04:02.430
Wait a minute! What are you talking about?

04:02.430 --> 04:04.680
He was injured during
his last assignment!

04:05.040 --> 04:06.430
<i>His last assignment?</i>

04:06.430 --> 04:09.670
Yes, it was a rescue mission to
evacuate the crew of the Karma!

04:09.670 --> 04:12.740
<i>I’m sorry, there must have
been a misunderstanding.</i>

04:12.740 --> 04:14.900
<i>I’m not aware of such an assignment.</i>

04:17.020 --> 04:21.350
I'm only an apprentice, but I know
Glen accepted that assignment!

04:21.350 --> 04:24.420
<i>But, there’s no such
record in our database...</i>

04:24.420 --> 04:26.140
Fine.

04:26.140 --> 04:28.910
I'll ask one more time. Bob is dead, right?

04:28.910 --> 04:31.330
— Yes.
— Thanks.

04:32.710 --> 04:36.290
<i>You’re just like Glen.</i>

04:38.990 --> 04:41.270
<i>Thank you for calling Tedan Tippedai.</i>

04:41.270 --> 04:45.280
My name is Iria, Hunter Glen's assistant. I need to speak to Mr. Puttabaya.

04:48.970 --> 04:51.310
<i>Iria, hang up, now!</i>

04:51.900 --> 04:56.750
<i>Mr. Puttabaya passed away in the
Karma accident several days ago...</i>

04:56.750 --> 04:58.280
Say what?

04:58.280 --> 05:00.140
<i>Get out of there!</i>

05:00.140 --> 05:04.810
<i>There were no survivors on the Karma. You didn’t know?</i>

05:04.810 --> 05:06.280
<i>What are you doing, Iria!</i>

05:09.200 --> 05:12.250
<i>— May I ask what this call is about?</i>
— Fujikuro!

05:20.560 --> 05:22.260
Hey, what are you doing?

05:24.220 --> 05:25.680
<i>The Borobdin’s gone!</i>

05:31.970 --> 05:33.690
Damn it!

05:33.690 --> 05:35.020
Where are you going?

05:37.480 --> 05:38.440
Iria!

05:40.770 --> 05:42.060
Stop screwing around!

05:42.060 --> 05:43.230
Do you want to die?

05:51.280 --> 05:52.870
Move!

05:53.090 --> 05:55.810
Little girl, wanna ride on my Dempadan?

05:55.810 --> 05:57.330
We'll go somewhere really nice.

06:00.130 --> 06:02.260
What the hell is this about?

06:06.550 --> 06:09.510
Are you gonna listen to me now?

06:09.870 --> 06:13.100
I bet you think I did that, huh?

06:13.100 --> 06:15.060
Is there any proof you didn't?

06:20.520 --> 06:22.170
Iria, hop in the back!

06:22.170 --> 06:23.480
I'll shake 'em!

06:26.360 --> 06:28.570
What do you think you're doing?

06:28.920 --> 06:32.780
You're throwing off my balance!

06:39.810 --> 06:41.450
Be careful!

06:41.450 --> 06:43.460
I said hop in, didn't I?

06:51.050 --> 06:52.760
— Incoming!
— Shut up!

07:04.320 --> 07:05.310
All clear!

07:05.310 --> 07:07.030
Whatever...

07:10.270 --> 07:11.720
Who are they?

07:11.720 --> 07:13.950
They're assassins
sent by Tedan Tippedai.

07:25.490 --> 07:27.330
Are they insane?

07:27.330 --> 07:30.300
The authorities will nail
them for shooting inside the city!

07:30.300 --> 07:32.260
I wouldn't bet on it.

07:32.350 --> 07:33.240
What?

07:33.240 --> 07:36.720
There's a rumour that
Zeiram's been spotted in Myce.

07:36.980 --> 07:38.320
Zeiram?

07:39.030 --> 07:40.040
Yeah.

07:40.040 --> 07:44.190
They can blame all kinds
of mayhem on Zeiram.

07:44.520 --> 07:47.380
— You think so?
— They're counting on it.

07:47.380 --> 07:49.650
Well, I bet that rumour's bogus.

07:50.220 --> 07:53.020
Really? You might be wrong.

07:53.020 --> 07:54.030
Huh?

07:54.480 --> 07:56.620
I've seen him, twice.

07:56.970 --> 07:59.450
You've seen Zeiram?

08:00.760 --> 08:06.380
Wait! Don't complicate things, I'm
getting paid to protect you.

08:06.740 --> 08:08.590
Protect me? By who?

08:08.870 --> 08:13.380
No clue. But I got half my fee through
the communication link.

08:13.380 --> 08:17.530
As long as you keep a low profile,
this'll be a piece of cake!

08:19.570 --> 08:22.590
I can protect myself, thank you.

08:22.590 --> 08:26.320
Besides, it's personal, I've got
a score to settle with Zeiram.

08:26.320 --> 08:27.480
Personal?

08:27.480 --> 08:28.610
<i>Fujikuro.</i>

08:29.000 --> 08:30.790
<i>Did you find Iria?</i>

08:30.790 --> 08:31.820
Yeah, she's right here.

08:32.200 --> 08:34.160
She's being a pain.

08:34.160 --> 08:36.470
Tell her to chill out for me, will ya?

08:36.470 --> 08:38.570
— Your client?
— Bingo!

08:38.570 --> 08:41.390
He sounds more trustworthy than you do.

08:42.130 --> 08:43.000
Fujikuro!

08:44.530 --> 08:45.830
We won't make it!

08:57.810 --> 09:00.300
My Dempadan...

09:00.300 --> 09:04.230
Wait! Just cooperate for
three more minutes, okay?

09:18.230 --> 09:19.910
Can you hear me?

09:19.910 --> 09:21.290
C'mon, mister!

09:24.770 --> 09:26.730
It's trashed.

09:31.280 --> 09:33.090
That's not fair...

10:44.250 --> 10:46.140
Fujikuro, you bastard!

10:50.560 --> 10:52.290
This blows!

11:26.090 --> 11:27.880
A little something...

11:50.320 --> 11:51.460
Hop in!

11:51.460 --> 11:53.130
What took you so long?

11:53.130 --> 11:55.470
It's been more than three minutes!

11:55.470 --> 11:57.410
I don't have a watch.

11:57.410 --> 11:59.000
See ya!

11:59.000 --> 12:02.050
Wait! I still gotta collect half my money!

12:08.740 --> 12:10.960
Get in, it's gonna start snowing.

12:58.490 --> 13:02.260
A whole lot of crap is going
down inside Tedan Tippedai.

13:02.640 --> 13:05.220
That's why they're after you.

13:05.580 --> 13:09.140
So, do you like eating that garbage?

13:11.170 --> 13:13.480
Shut up, and keep talking.

13:13.480 --> 13:15.310
Some kind of problem with the cargo...

13:15.310 --> 13:16.650
Zeiram was the cargo.

13:16.650 --> 13:18.320
What, Zeiram?

13:18.320 --> 13:19.880
— Really?
— Yup.

13:19.880 --> 13:22.430
I can't believe it...

13:22.430 --> 13:24.450
So what the hell is Zeiram?

13:24.450 --> 13:25.660
Huh?

13:26.610 --> 13:28.890
You saw it twice, right?

13:28.890 --> 13:30.000
Yup.

13:30.450 --> 13:33.050
Can't you tell by looking at it?

13:33.580 --> 13:38.140
Zeiram's an immortal,
ferocious space monster.

13:38.140 --> 13:41.450
If you could control it, it
would be the ultimate weapon.

13:41.450 --> 13:45.740
Looks like some idiots wanted to get
a hold of it for their own benefit.

13:45.740 --> 13:49.630
I bet they paid for it
with their own blood.

13:49.630 --> 13:55.620
Either way, the authorities banned anybody
from keeping Zeiram as a pet long ago.

13:55.620 --> 13:57.390
Common sense, really!

13:57.390 --> 14:01.120
So Tedan Tippedai was
trying to bring it onto Myce?

14:01.120 --> 14:03.760
If it worked out, they would
have made serious money.

14:03.760 --> 14:07.240
The sad truth is that some
people just care about money.

14:09.700 --> 14:11.970
I think I got it!

14:11.970 --> 14:14.570
Tedan Tippedai didn't want
the secret to get out,

14:14.570 --> 14:18.710
so they started this rumour to keep
everyone connected to the case quiet.

14:18.710 --> 14:22.170
That's why the record's been wiped out.

14:22.410 --> 14:26.130
God knows what happened
to the rescued crew.

14:26.490 --> 14:28.590
They're not going to pay you, either.

14:32.810 --> 14:34.770
<i>Stop!</i>

14:34.950 --> 14:36.330
<i>Can you handle him?</i>

14:36.330 --> 14:37.230
<i>You’re still a rookie...</i>

14:43.020 --> 14:44.610
<i>Glen!</i>

14:44.770 --> 14:45.940
<i>Leave!</i>

14:45.940 --> 14:47.400
<i>I’ll use the pod under the bridge!</i>

14:47.600 --> 14:49.440
<i>That’s not gonna kill him.</i>

14:49.440 --> 14:51.370
<i>Leave while you still have the chance!</i>

14:51.540 --> 14:53.040
<i>This is our chance!</i>

14:53.040 --> 14:55.080
<i>Freeze it while it’s distracted!</i>

14:57.840 --> 15:00.260
<i>Get away as far as you can.</i>

15:00.260 --> 15:01.750
<i>Take care of yourself, all right?</i>

15:08.750 --> 15:10.720
I still haven't taken a shower...

15:11.100 --> 15:12.340
What?

15:13.650 --> 15:15.700
Is Bob really dead?

15:15.700 --> 15:18.270
Yeah, I had to identify the body.

15:18.740 --> 15:20.980
Are you sure it was Bob?

15:20.980 --> 15:23.540
Absolutely positive.

15:23.540 --> 15:26.440
The bastard that never
gave me the good jobs.

15:39.680 --> 15:42.870
<i>This is very important to me.</i>

15:44.220 --> 15:45.590
What's that?

15:49.120 --> 15:52.140
<i>Ranfan, it’s finally time to take off.</i>

15:52.140 --> 15:57.510
<i>Those cowards are still worried, but I guarantee everything will be just fine.</i>

15:57.510 --> 15:59.320
<i>Just leave it up to me.</i>

15:59.670 --> 16:04.290
<i>It’s quite simple, even
a child could control Zeiram.</i>

16:04.900 --> 16:08.870
<i>Ranfan, you won’t believe
it when you see this.</i>

16:10.210 --> 16:14.070
I can't believe you're still
alive, carrying that thing around.

16:14.070 --> 16:18.260
Fujikuro, take me to Tedan Tippedai.

16:18.260 --> 16:19.080
What?

16:19.080 --> 16:21.130
Are you crazy?

16:21.130 --> 16:23.370
Do I look like your chauffeur?

16:24.160 --> 16:26.380
I said, take me to Tedan Tippedai.

16:26.380 --> 16:29.920
I saved your life, remember that!

16:37.350 --> 16:40.880
I'm sure Vice President
Puttabaya is still alive.

16:40.880 --> 16:42.390
Maybe.

16:42.390 --> 16:43.060
Hurry!

16:46.480 --> 16:49.160
Come on, cool it!

16:49.160 --> 16:51.900
What are you gonna do
if he's alive?

16:51.900 --> 16:53.860
You're not gonna kill him, are you?

16:54.250 --> 16:56.110
I won't know until I see him!

17:00.730 --> 17:03.290
Slow down, this is a residential zone!

17:06.250 --> 17:09.460
<i>This is a Hunter, my
vessel is losing control.</i>

17:09.460 --> 17:11.950
<i>We may collide with Tedan Tippedai.</i>

17:11.950 --> 17:13.550
<i>Please take cover!</i>

17:28.590 --> 17:31.400
I'm Iria, Hunter Glen's assistant.

17:31.400 --> 17:33.540
Take me to Mr. Puttabaya.

17:33.540 --> 17:35.370
Mr. Puttabaya's...

17:35.370 --> 17:36.410
Freeze!

17:36.410 --> 17:38.000
Identify yourself!

17:39.970 --> 17:42.490
I can't keep up with this.

17:42.670 --> 17:44.500
Drop your weapon and turn around!

17:45.770 --> 17:48.140
<i>She’s finally here...</i>

17:48.140 --> 17:50.150
<i>You’re reckless, as usual.</i>

17:50.150 --> 17:52.960
It's you again! What do you mean by "as usual"?

17:53.230 --> 17:55.360
<i>Mr. Puttabaya is on the 94th floor.</i>

17:55.360 --> 17:57.930
<i>Use the elevators from three to twelve.</i>

17:58.700 --> 18:02.400
You weren't so helpful on Taowajan...

18:02.400 --> 18:04.850
<i>It was a transmission delay,
that wasn’t my fault.</i>

18:04.850 --> 18:06.970
<i>Hurry, before they cut you off!</i>

18:06.970 --> 18:08.940
I don't need you to tell me that.

19:32.910 --> 19:36.190
<i>Iria, you’ve gone too far. Go down two more floors.</i>

19:36.430 --> 19:39.150
<i>— It’s right below you!</i>
— Damn!

19:42.770 --> 19:43.710
Found her!

20:05.850 --> 20:09.890
I suppose you have a death
wish, coming in here like this.

20:09.890 --> 20:12.500
Is the crew of the Karma still alive?

20:12.500 --> 20:17.820
Of course. They're adjusting to their
new lives with new identities.

20:18.030 --> 20:19.820
What about you?

20:19.820 --> 20:26.280
You're supposed to be dead, so killing
you wouldn't make a difference, huh?

20:26.560 --> 20:31.210
Perhaps, but do you think
you're leaving here alive?

20:31.210 --> 20:34.620
You're already a wanted criminal.

20:34.900 --> 20:39.090
I'll have no regrets if I can kill
the guy I risked my life to rescue.

20:39.170 --> 20:40.290
Just wait.

20:40.290 --> 20:42.390
I do appreciate your efforts.

20:42.390 --> 20:44.680
I even have a gift here for you.

20:48.660 --> 20:49.640
A gift?

20:50.000 --> 20:52.140
Your pay.

20:52.140 --> 20:57.610
I would usually pay Ghomvak Security,
but the money comes from the same place.

20:57.610 --> 21:00.070
Take this, and go home quietly.

21:00.390 --> 21:03.070
Don't worry, I'll be taking my pay.

21:03.250 --> 21:05.350
There you go, you're
doing the right thing.

21:05.350 --> 21:09.850
By the way, can I ask you a question?

21:09.850 --> 21:10.540
What is it?

21:10.750 --> 21:13.250
Do you have my pendant?

21:14.280 --> 21:16.130
Your "important" thing.

21:16.130 --> 21:18.710
— That's right.
— I have it.

21:18.710 --> 21:20.560
— Really?
— Sure.

21:20.560 --> 21:21.800
Do you have it on you?

21:23.420 --> 21:25.550
Thank God, may I have it back?

21:25.810 --> 21:28.170
Who is this girl?

21:28.170 --> 21:29.510
T-That's my daughter...

21:29.510 --> 21:31.710
— Her name?
— Her name is Shanti.

21:31.710 --> 21:35.100
Then Ranfan must be your wife.

21:37.970 --> 21:41.870
Or maybe your mistress.

21:41.870 --> 21:44.240
"Ranfan, you won't believe it..."

21:45.850 --> 21:48.200
You won't leave here alive!

21:54.750 --> 21:55.910
Kill her!

22:17.940 --> 22:19.700
We got her!

22:22.360 --> 22:25.410
Sorry, but we'll be
hanging out a bit longer.

22:26.350 --> 22:28.060
We still have to talk!

22:28.060 --> 22:30.030
You...

22:30.190 --> 22:32.490
You didn't save Bob, did you?

22:54.210 --> 22:55.770
This is for Bob!

22:55.930 --> 22:57.230
What?

23:08.860 --> 23:11.050
This is for my brother!

23:15.670 --> 23:19.300
I'll explain everything
to the authorities!

23:19.300 --> 23:20.620
Explain what?

23:20.620 --> 23:21.850
<i>Iria, go up!</i>

23:21.850 --> 23:23.340
— Upstairs?
<i>— To the top floor.</i>

23:25.080 --> 23:27.390
I was hoping to go down.

23:27.390 --> 23:29.790
<i>Use elevator two, hurry!</i>

23:29.790 --> 23:30.830
Dammit!

23:31.690 --> 23:33.440
Now, hurry up!

23:38.260 --> 23:42.290
I wonder if he wants me to
jump off the top floor again...

23:46.530 --> 23:47.900
Stand back!

23:48.140 --> 23:50.860
<i>There’s a teleporter in
the central control room.</i>

23:59.700 --> 24:02.670
<i>Iria, you made it! Good to see you.</i>

24:04.450 --> 24:07.300
So, you're the one
who's been helping me!

24:07.300 --> 24:09.500
<i>I’m glad I could help!</i>

24:09.500 --> 24:11.830
— Thank you.
<i>— You’re welcome.</i>

24:11.830 --> 24:13.600
But, who are you?

24:13.600 --> 24:16.850
<i>You don’t remember my voice? I’m shocked.</i>

24:21.060 --> 24:24.020
<i>You’re just like Glen.</i>

24:25.340 --> 24:26.720
Bob!

24:26.720 --> 24:27.730
Is it really you?

24:28.000 --> 24:31.020
Oh Bob, what did they do to you?

24:31.020 --> 24:33.220
<i>I may look like this,
but it’s not that bad.</i>

24:33.220 --> 24:38.160
<i>The security on this computer
is so tight, I can’t get out! Take me with you.</i>

24:38.160 --> 24:39.950
Okay, no problem!

24:42.660 --> 24:46.380
<i>— Was Fujikuro helpful?</i>
— Somewhat.

24:50.300 --> 24:51.760
And that was for me!

24:52.240 --> 24:54.980
<i>Unlatch the dock.</i>

24:54.980 --> 24:56.720
<i>We leave in twenty seconds.</i>

25:10.360 --> 25:11.820
Damn it...

25:12.070 --> 25:15.700
I suggest you forget about Zeiram
in your new life, Mr. Puttabaya.

25:15.700 --> 25:17.530
After all, you're supposed to be dead.

25:24.060 --> 25:25.750
Damn...

25:43.520 --> 25:45.340
Damn it!

26:23.010 --> 26:28.200
<i>The morning to come
does not matter...</i>

26:28.200 --> 26:35.460
<i>let's go as we are now.</i>

26:41.410 --> 26:47.760
<i>We're passing a blue star...</i>

26:47.760 --> 26:53.820
<i>a tiny floating light.</i>

26:53.820 --> 27:00.270
<i>It's just the two
of us, no need to speak.</i>

27:00.270 --> 27:05.870
<i>Looking out over the city...</i>

27:05.870 --> 27:12.320
<i>The painful memories we have shared...</i>

27:12.320 --> 27:17.590
<i>they will be put to rest tonight.</i>

27:17.590 --> 27:24.160
<i>And the night to come
does not matter...</i>

27:24.160 --> 27:31.330
<i>let's go without looking back.</i>

27:31.330 --> 27:36.610
<i>Even though our dreams are far away...</i>

27:36.610 --> 27:43.860
<i>I will never let them go.</i>

27:57.780 --> 28:00.900
Iria decides to keep moving forward,

28:01.590 --> 28:04.400
as if she is drawn to something.

28:04.400 --> 28:07.080
Iria encounters a scientist...

28:07.390 --> 28:10.330
Little visitors from Utopia...

28:10.980 --> 28:18.390
And the murderous monster from
darkness shows illusions to Iria.

28:18.390 --> 28:21.930
He might be a clone, but this
ugly beast looks nothing like Glen!

28:22.050 --> 28:26.680
Broom Tree.
